{
  "abstract": "This document discusses manageability of the QUIC transport protocol and focuses on the implications of QUIC's design and wire image on network operations involving QUIC traffic. It is intended as a \"user's manual\" for the wire image to provide guidance for network operators and equipment vendors who rely on the use of transport-aware network functions.",
